    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d755">

                <pb facs="1212" n="1116" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1116"/>

                <head>No. 752.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish to Mr. Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-12-22"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 22,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my conversation with you on
                    the subject of carrying out the agreement of the United States with Spain,
                    respecting proceedings against the Virginius and against the persons who may
                    appeal to have been guilty of illegal actions in connection therewith, I have
                    now <pb facs="1213" n="1117" xml:id="pg1117"/> the honor to inclose copies of
                    the protocol of the 29th ultimo, between Admiral Polo and myself, and of the
                    agreement of the 8th of December, and to request that the steps necessary to
                    carry out the same may be taken by the Department of Justice.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c,</p>
                <closer><signed>HAMILTON FISH.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
